od eggs. When the window broke, the logistics officer was just like that window there; they just couldn't keep their mouth shut about docking her pay for it and all!","spans":[{"text":"Not all humans are good eggs. When the window broke, the logistics officer was just like that window there; they just couldn't keep their mouth shut about docking her pay for it and all!"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.6,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":true},{"imgId":143,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":false}],"heroFace":[{"imgId":143,"faceId":3}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_04#19"},"cpt_clotho_02_04#19":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_04#19","act":19,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":143,"name":"Hel","rawName":"Hel","isProfessor":false,"faces":[{"imgId":143,"faceId":0}],"dialogPos":3,"lookup":"헬"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_04#19","rawText":"Fortunately, I'm a coffin and I can help Clotho block out the wind and rain, but I can't sprout eight arms and legs...","displayText":"Fortunately, I'm a coffin and I can help Clotho block out the wind and rain, but I can't sprout eight arms and legs...","spans":[{"text":"Fortunately, I'm a coffin and I can help Clotho block out the wind and rain, but I can't sprout eight arms and legs..."}]}],"stageRaw":{"heroFace":[{"imgId":143,"faceId":0}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_04#20"},"cpt_clotho_02_04#20":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_04#20","act":20,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1039,"name":"Centaureissi","rawName":"Centaureissi","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":1,"lookup":"센타우레이시"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_04#20","rawText":"Even if you weren't a coffin, you might not have eight arms and legs.","displayText":"Even if you weren't a coffin, you might not have eight arms and legs.","spans":[{"text":"Even if you weren't a coffin, you might not have eight arms and legs."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":false},{"imgId":143,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posI